OL,3,                                      W5
OL,4,CService stations transformed         W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GService stations have been a fixture W5
OL,7,Gon the nation's motorway network for W5
OL,8,Gmore than six decades, but while     W5
OL,9,Gthey may once have been just a place W5
OL,10,Gto go when needing a break on a long W5
OL,11,Gdrive, could it be that these        W5
OL,12,Groadside retreats have now evolved   W5
OL,13,Ginto destinations in their own right?W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,GNext to the motorway near Rotherham, W5
OL,16,Gwhere traffic seems to be forever    W5
OL,17,Gthundering by, is a covered square,  W5
OL,18,Gsurrounded by what at first appears  W5
OL,19,Gto be sandy-coloured stone buildings W5
OL,20,G- and there is a general air of calm.W5
